<title>UK: Montreal adds 60 million marks to seven-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Montreal adds 60 million marks to seven-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue has been increased lead manager DG Bank said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITY OF MONTREAL</p>
<p> AMT    *170 MLN DEM  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    16.OCT.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     15 BP     PAY DATE  **09.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    FFURT     DENOMS (K) 10	  GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  10 BP     LIST FEE    5 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     *LAUNCHED FOR 110 MILLION MARKS ON 11.SEP.96.</p>
<p>	    **PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
